/URI (mailto:?subject=EXCLUSIVE%20LEAD%3A%20788%20Blockchain-Verified%20Documents%20%E2%80%94%20Australian%20Whistleblower%2C%2014%20Psych%20Wards%2C%20Found%20With%20No%20Pulse%2C%20ICC%20Article%207%20Filed&body=To%20the%20newsroom%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20forwarding%20this%20because%20I%20believe%20it%20may%20be%20one%20of%20the%20most%20under-reported%20public-interest%20stories%20in%20Australian%20history.%0A%0ADr%20Richard%20William%20McLean%20\(known%20online%20as%20%22Barran%20Dodger%22\)%20has%20assembled%20a%20788-document%20blockchain-verified%20archive%20exposing%2035%20years%20of%20systematic%20persecution%20by%2035%2B%20Australian%20government%20agencies.%0A%0AKey%20verifiable%20facts%3A%0A%E2%80%A2%2014%20forced%20psychiatric%20hospitalisations%20across%203%20states%0A%E2%80%A2%20Documented%20assassination%20attempt%20%E2%80%94%20found%20with%20no%20pulse%20\(Werribee%20Mercy%20Hospital%2C%20Werribee%20Mercy%20Hospital%2C%202021\)%0A%E2%80%A2%20ICC%20Article%207%20\(crimes%20against%20humanity\)%20complaint%20filed%20and%20received%20at%20The%20Hague%0A%E2%80%A2%20UNHCR%20asylum%20submission%20filed%20%E2%80%94%20reference%3A%20UR%2FUST%2F23%2FAUS%2F17%0A%E2%80%A2%20Attorney-General%20Mark%20Dreyfus%20notified%20in%202021%20%E2%80%94%20chose%20silence%0A%E2%80%A2%20891%20Bitcoin%20blockchain%20timestamps%20%E2%80%94%20every%20document%20cryptographically%20sealed%0A%E2%80%A2%20AI%20analysis%3A%20603%20propositions%20assessed%2C%20zero%20contradictions%20found%0A%E2%80%A2%20Not%20one%20defamation%20action%20filed%20by%20any%20agency%2C%20minister%2C%20or%20official%20in%2035%20years%0A%0AThe%20archive%20is%20freely%20downloadable%20at%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%2Farchive-detonation%0A%0AEverything%20is%20public.%20Everything%20is%20verified.%20Everything%20is%20downloadable.%0A%0AI%20DARE%20YOU%20TO%20PROVE%20ME%20WRONG.%0A%0A%E2%80%94%20A%20reader%20of%20barrandodger.com)>>>>
